摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: describe_image — give a text-only model vision through an OpenAI-compatible VLM endpoint","id":"gh:1333893162","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugin-describe-image","slug":"whitelonng/dsh-plugin-describe-image","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","describe-image","dsh","dsh-plugin","image-understanding","llm","multimodal","qwen-vl","vision","vlm"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: describe_image — give a text-only model vision through an OpenAI-compatible"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ess plugin: describe_image — give a text-only model vision through an OpenAI-compatible VLM endpoint"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-describe-image"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**DeepSeek Harness 图片理解插件** — a vision-language `describe_image` tool that gives a **text-only model"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"** (DeepSeek V4 and friends) the ability to understand images."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness plugin: the model-facing `describe_image` tool. It loads one image — a local file"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" path, an http(s) URL, or a durable attachment reference — and asks a **vision-language model (VLM)*"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"* at an **OpenAI-compatible endpoint** (Qwen-VL, GLM-4V, GPT-4o, or a local Ollama endpoint) to desc"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ribe it. Only the returned **text** crosses into the conversation; the image itself never enters the"},{"id":"p5s5","text":" session log. Keywords: DeepSeek Harness plugin, describe_image tool, image understanding, image des"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"cription, multimodal, vision-language model, VLM, text-only model, Qwen-VL, GLM-4V, GPT-4o, Ollama."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The desktop app's plugin list accepts the same spec in its install box (`github:whitelonng/dsh-plugi"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"n-describe-image`); the plugin loads after an application restart."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Three input forms**: local path, http(s) URL, or the JSON of an `[image attachment …]` note (res"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"olved through the harness attachment service — copy the note verbatim into `image`).\n- **Live config"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"uration card**: the Web GUI's Settings → Plugins → \"Image understanding\" card edits `baseURL`, `mode"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"l`, and the API key (via the credential seam) with immediate effect — no restart.\n- **Per-call API k"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"ey resolution**: inline `apiKey` → credential seam (`apiKeyEnv`, default `VISION_API_KEY`) → launch "},{"id":"p10s6","text":"environment.\n- **Security and bounds**: redirects refused on every request, `maxBytes` / `maxOutputT"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"okens` / `timeoutMs` bounds, magic-byte media-type gate, bounded error excerpts, secrets never logge"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"d.\n- **Companion harness changes** (shipped in the harness repo, not this subtree): the DeepSeek tex"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"t-only route flattens image blocks into the copyable `[image attachment …]` notes, and the host acce"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"pts image prompts on text-only routes — together they close the \"send an image to a text-only model\""},{"id":"p10s11","text":"age prompts on text-only routes — together they close the \"send an image to a text-only model\" loop."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Quick start (in a DeepSeek Harness checkout)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## FAQ"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**What does this plugin do?**\nIt adds the `describe_image` tool to DeepSeek Harness: the agent (or u"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ser) hands the tool an image, the tool asks a configured vision-language model to describe it, and o"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"nly the description text goes back into the conversation."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Which vision models work?**\nAny OpenAI-compatible vision endpoint: Qwen-VL (`https://dashscope.ali"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"yuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1`), GLM-4V, GPT-4o, or a local Ollama endpoint. Set `baseURL` and `model"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"` in Settings → Plugins → \"Image understanding\"."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Does the image itself enter the conversation or the session log?**\nNo. The image is loaded, checke"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"d, and sent only to the vision endpoint; the session log and the model see only the returned descrip"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"t only to the vision endpoint; the session log and the model see only the returned description text."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**How do I install it?**\nRun `dsh plugin --profile web add github:whitelonng/dsh-plugin-describe-ima"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ge`, or paste the same spec into the desktop app's plugin install box. Restart the application after"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"r paste the same spec into the desktop app's plugin install box. Restart the application afterwards."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**How is the API key configured?**\nThree layers, in order: an inline `apiKey` in config, the credent"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ial seam (`apiKeyEnv`, default `VISION_API_KEY`), then the launch environment. The key is never writ"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"KeyEnv`, default `VISION_API_KEY`), then the launch environment. The key is never written into logs."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Is it safe against malicious input?**\nRedirects are refused, media type is gated by magic bytes, s"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"izes and output tokens are bounded, and error excerpts are truncated — a hostile image or endpoint c"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"annot exfiltrate secrets."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"This repository holds the plugin subtree **as it lives inside** `deepseek-harness`: package dependen"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"cies stay `workspace:^`, and building, type-checking, and testing happen inside a harness checkout ("},{"id":"p22s3","text":"see INTEGRATION.md). The harness tree is the build environment, not this repo. Keep the two in sync "},{"id":"p22s4","text":"NTEGRATION.md). The harness tree is the build environment, not this repo. Keep the two in sync with:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
